* Common-collector input characteristic (PNP 2N3906)
* collector at the common (ground) node, emitter supply VEE = 1 ... 4 V
* (VCE = VEE).  inner sweep: VBB (referred to ground, swept 5 -> -3 V)
* outer sweep: VEE (emitter supply)
VEE nes 0 0
RE nes e 0.1
Q1 0 b e Q2N3906
VBB nbs 0 0
RB nbs b 22k
.MODEL Q2N3906 PNP(IS=1.41F XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=18.7 BF=180.7 NE=1.5
+ ISE=0 IKF=80m XTB=1.5 BR=4.977 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 RC=2.5
+ CJC=9.728P MJC=.5776 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=8.063P MJE=.3677 VJE=.75
+ TR=33.42N TF=179.3P ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=6 RB=10)
.SAVE all @q1[ic] @q1[ib] @q1[ie]
.DC VBB 5 -3 -0.01 VEE 1 4 1
.PROBE
.END
